    { "id": "s3h", "type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 550, "width": 900, "height": 35, "text": "3. BOOT SEQUENCE — pi/boot.py :: boot_sequence()", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bb-1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 610, "width": 320, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tb-1", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 625, "width": 290, "height": 40, "text": "Boot Step 1\nConfigManager().load()\n→ loads config/pi_config.yaml", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bb-2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 390, "y": 610, "width": 320, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tb-2", "type": "text", "x": 405, "y": 625, "width": 290, "height": 40, "text": "Boot Step 2\nStatusLED(green=23, red=24)\nStartSwitch(pin=25, pull-up)", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bb-3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 750, "y": 610, "width": 320, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tb-3", "type": "text", "x": 765, "y": 625, "width": 290, "height": 40, "text": "Boot Step 3\nLED blink_pattern:\n[\"green\",\"red\",\"off\"] @ 0.15s", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bb-4", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 720, "width": 490, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tb-4", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 735, "width": 460, "height": 40, "text": "Boot Step 4  —  power_on_self_test()\nCreates all sensor/control instances → runs 18+ tests", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "arr-b1", "type": "arrow", "x": 350, "y": 645, "width": 40, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "points": [[0,0],[40,0]] },
    { "id": "arr-b2", "type": "arrow", "x": 710, "y": 645, "width": 40, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "points": [[0,0],[40,0]] },
    { "id": "arr-b3", "type": "arrow", "x": 910, "y": 680, "width": 0, "height": 40, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "points": [[0,0],[0,40]] },

    { "id": "bb-5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 830, "width": 490, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tb-5", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 840, "width": 460, "height": 60, "text": "Boot Step 5 — Decision\nALL TESTS PASSED → success_sequence()\n  Green LED blinks 3× → steady ON\n  \"Press switch to start race\"\n  switch.wait_for_press() → led.set(\"blue\") → return True\n\nANY FAILED → error_sequence()\n  Red LED blinks → return False", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "arr-b4", "type": "arrow", "x": 275, "y": 790, "width": 0, "height": 40, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "points": [[0,0],[0,40]] },

    { "id": "s3b-detail", "type": "text", "x": 600, "y": 830, "width": 500, "height": 30, "text": "POWER-ON SELF-TEST DETAIL:", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "b-post-detail", "type": "rectangle", "x": 570, "y": 870, "width": 570, "height": 250, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "t-post-detail", "type": "text", "x": 585, "y": 885, "width": 540, "height": 220, "text": "Instances Created in power_on_self_test() [boot.py line 46-57]:\n\n📷 PiCamera(device=0, 640×480, 60fps)\n📡 VL53L0X(\"left\", 0x30)  +  VL53L0X(\"right\", 0x31)\n📡 VL53L1X(\"front\", 0x32)\n🔄 MPU6050(bus=1, addr=0x68)     +  QMC5883L(bus=1, addr=0x0D)\n🧮 RobotUKF(dt=0.01)             +  ComplementaryFilter(alpha=0.98)\n🎯 StanleyController(k=0.5)      +  ServoPID(kp=0.8)\n⚙️ MotorPID(kp=0.5)              +  KinematicModel(wheelbase=0.26)\n🔌 UARTCommunicator(/dev/serial0, 115200)\n\nTests Registered with SelfTestRunner:\n  camera: 2 tests  |  ToF: 3 tests  |  IMU: 2 tests  |  Mag: 2 tests\n  fusion: 2 tests  |  control: 4 tests  |  comm: 6 tests\n  → Total: 18+ test functions across 7 files\n\nrunner.run_all():  [OK] name  PASS  12.3ms  |  [!!] name  FAIL  \"error msg\"", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "s4h", "type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 1180, "width": 900, "height": 35, "text": "4. MAIN RACE LOOP — main.py :: main() — SystemManager + 7 Async Tasks", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "b-mainpy", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 1230, "width": 380, "height": 120, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "t-mainpy", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 1245, "width": 350, "height": 90, "text": "SystemManager [manager.py]\n  ConfigManager → pi_config.yaml\n  TaskScheduler — priority-sorted async tasks\n  HealthMonitor — timeout=2s heartbeat check\n  PerformanceMonitor — psutil CPU/RAM thread\n  register(name, component) → dict\n  init_all() → comp.init() each\n  run() / stop() / shutdown()", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "b-main-components", "type": "rectangle", "x": 450, "y": 1230, "width": 700, "height": 200, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "t-main-components", "type": "text", "x": 465, "y": 1245, "width": 670, "height": 170, "text": "Components Created & Registered [main.py lines 38-82]:\n\n📷 PiCamera(0, 640, 480, 60fps)\n📡 VL53L0X(\"Left\", 0x30)  |  VL53L0X(\"Right\", 0x31)  |  VL53L1X(\"Front\", 0x32)\n🔄 MPU6050(1, 0x68)       |  QMC5883L(1, 0x0D)\n🧮 RobotUKF(dt=0.01)     |  ComplementaryFilter(0.98, 0.01)\n🧮 AdaptiveNoiseEstimator(window=100)  |  MahalanobisOutlierRejector(threshold=3.0)\n📍 RobotLocalization → attach_filter(ukf)\n👁️ LaneDetector(roi=0.4)  |  WallDetector(thresh=500mm)  |  FreeSpaceDetector\n🎯 StateMachine + LapCounter(2 laps)  |  GlobalPlanner → plan_lap(3.0, 5.0)\n📐 CubicSplineTrajectory(50pts)  |  VelocityProfiler\n🚗 KinematicModel(wheelbase=0.26)\n🎮 StanleyController(k=0.5)  |  ServoPID(kp=0.8)  |  MotorPID(kp=0.5)\n🔌 UARTCommunicator(/dev/serial0, 115200)\n\nRegistered: camera, tof_left, tof_right, tof_front, imu, mag, ukf, localization, state_machine, uart", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "s5h", "type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 1480, "width": 900, "height": 35, "text": "5. SEVEN ASYNC TASKS — Priority Order (highest → lowest)", "font-size": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bt1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 1530, "width": 310, "height": 170, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tt1", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 1540, "width": 280, "height": 150, "text": "TASK 1: sensor_task\n▶ Freq: 100 Hz  |  Priority: 10\n▶ What it does:\n  camera_data = camera.read()\n  tof_l = tof_left.read()\n  tof_r = tof_right.read()\n  tof_f = tof_front.read()\n  imu_data = imu.read()\n  mag_data = mag.read()\n  mgr.health.heartbeat(\"sensors\")\n  await asyncio.sleep(0.01)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bt2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 370, "y": 1530, "width": 310, "height": 170, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tt2", "type": "text", "x": 385, "y": 1540, "width": 280, "height": 150, "text": "TASK 2: fusion_task\n▶ Freq: 100 Hz  |  Priority: 9\n▶ What it does:\n  heading = mag.heading(mag, accel)\n  pitch, roll, yaw = comp_filter.update(\n    accel, gyro, heading)\n  ukf.predict()\n  ukf.update(z)\n  localization.pose.update_absolute(\n    state[0], state[1], state[2])\n  mgr.health.heartbeat(\"fusion\")\n  await asyncio.sleep(0.01)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bt3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 710, "y": 1530, "width": 310, "height": 170, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tt3", "type": "text", "x": 725, "y": 1540, "width": 280, "height": 150, "text": "TASK 3: perception_task\n▶ Freq: 50 Hz  |  Priority: 8\n▶ What it does:\n  frame = camera.frame\n  if frame is not None:\n    lanes = lane_detector.detect(\n      frame)  (Canny→HoughLines)\n    free = free_space.detect(\n      frame)  (Sobel→binary thresh)\n  mgr.health.heartbeat(\"perception\")\n  await asyncio.sleep(0.02)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bt4", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 1730, "width": 310, "height": 150, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tt4", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 1740, "width": 280, "height": 130, "text": "TASK 4: planning_task\n▶ Freq: 20 Hz  |  Priority: 7\n▶ What it does:\n  pose = localization.to_dict()\n  target = global_planner.get_target(0)\n  (gets next rectangle waypoint)\n  mgr.health.heartbeat(\"planning\")\n  await asyncio.sleep(0.05)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bt5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 370, "y": 1730, "width": 310, "height": 190, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tt5", "type": "text", "x": 385, "y": 1740, "width": 280, "height": 170, "text": "★ TASK 5: control_task ← KEY TASK\n▶ Freq: 100 Hz  |  Priority: 6\n▶ What it does:\n  pose = localization.to_dict()\n  target = global_planner.get_target(0)\n  if target:\n    steering = stanley.compute(x, y, h,\n      tx, ty, th, v)\n    motor_speed = motor_pid.compute_speed(1.0, v)\n    servo_angle = servo_pid.compute_angle(steering, 0.0)\n    uart.send_steering(servo_angle, motor_speed)\n  mgr.health.heartbeat(\"control\")\n  await asyncio.sleep(0.01)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bt6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 710, "y": 1730, "width": 310, "height": 170, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tt6", "type": "text", "x": 725, "y": 1740, "width": 280, "height": 150, "text": "TASK 6: comm_task\n▶ Freq: 200 Hz  |  Priority: 5\n▶ What it does:\n  pkt = uart.read()\n  // reads /dev/serial0\n  // decodes 0xA5 packet\n  // validates CRC-16\n  // if STATUS_RESPONSE:\n  //   update last_heartbeat\n  mgr.health.heartbeat(\"comm\")\n  await asyncio.sleep(0.005)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bt7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 1910, "width": 310, "height": 170, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "tt7", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 1920, "width": 280, "height": 150, "text": "TASK 7: health_task\n▶ Freq: 2 Hz  |  Priority: 0 (lowest)\n▶ What it does:\n  results = mgr.health.check_all()\n  dead = [k for k,v in results if not v]\n  if dead: log.warn(f\"Dead: {dead}\")\n  (PerformanceMonitor runs in\n   separate daemon thread)\n  await asyncio.sleep(0.5)\n\nAlso running in background:\n  • PerformanceMonitor (psutil CPU/RAM)\n  • MemoryManager (auto GC)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "bt5-arrow", "type": "arrow", "x": 680, "y": 1820, "width": 30, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "points": [[0,0],[30,0]] },

    { "id": "s6h", "type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 2130, "width": 900, "height": 35, "text": "6. STATE MACHINE — pi/mission/state_machine.py", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "b-sm", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 2180, "width": 1000, "height": 180, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "t-sm", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 2195, "width": 970, "height": 150, "text": "RobotState Enum:  INIT → IDLE → START_SEARCH → FORWARD → CORNERING → OBSTACLE_AVOID → REVERSE → LAP_FINISHED → PARK\nAlso: EMERGENCY_STOP, SHUTDOWN\n\nStateMachine class:\n  add_transition(from, to, condition)  — condition is callable → bool\n  set_entry(state, action) / set_exit(state, action)  — triggers on enter/leave\n  update(dt):  — iterate transitions, if condition met → transition_to(dst)\n  transition_to(new_state):  — exit action → update state → entry action\n\nOther Mission Components:\n  • LapCounter(total_laps=2)  — mark_crossing() → current_lap++, finished @ ≥2\n  • RaceStrategy — mode: exploration(0.6×) → racing(1.0×) or cautious(0.5×)\n  • StartDetector (template match)  |  ObstacleStrategy (ToF-based)\n  • ReverseLogic (4WS reverse)  |  Checkpoint (waypoint progress)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "s7h", "type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 2410, "width": 900, "height": 35, "text": "7. ESP32-S3 FIRMWARE — app_main() + 5 FreeRTOS Tasks", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "b-esp-init", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 2460, "width": 450, "height": 220, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#fff3e0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "t-esp-init", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 2475, "width": 420, "height": 190, "text": "app_main() Init Sequence [main.c lines 283-326]:\n\nStep 1:  memset state → ESP_STATE_BOOT, led_both_on()\nStep 2:  led_init()  — GPIO2(Green), GPIO4(Red)\nStep 3:  uart_init()  — UART1, GPIO17=TX, GPIO18=RX, 115200 8N1\nStep 4:  tb6612fng_init()  — GPIO10(STBY)=HIGH\nStep 5:  servo_pwm_init()  — GPIO13, LEDC TIM0, 50Hz 12-bit\nStep 6:  motor_pwm_init()  — GPIO11, LEDC TIM1, 20kHz 10-bit\nStep 7:  watchdog_init()  — esp_task_wdt(3000ms, panic=true)\nStep 8:  failsafe_init()\nStep 9:  state = ESP_STATE_SELFTEST\n         esp_selftest_init() + esp_selftest_run()\nStep 10: ALL PASSED → state=READY, Green LED ON\n         FAILED → state=ERROR, Red LED ON\nStep 11: xTaskCreate × 5 tasks\nStep 12: while(1) { vTaskDelay(1000ms); }", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "b-esp-tasks", "type": "rectangle", "x": 520, "y": 2460, "width": 650, "height": 350, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#fff3e0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "t-esp-tasks", "type": "text", "x": 535, "y": 2475, "width": 620, "height": 320, "text": "FreeRTOS Tasks (5 concurrent):\n\nTASK 1: uart_rx_task  (stack=4096, priority=10)  [main.c:197]\n  Reads UART bytes → detects 0xA5 header → collects payload → 0x5A footer\n  → CRC-16 verify → process_packet():\n    • PKT_STEERING_CMD (0x03):  servo_set_angle(angle) + motor_set_speed(speed)\n    • PKT_EMERGENCY_STOP (0xFF):  motors off, state=FAILSAFE\n    • PKT_STATUS_REQ (0x04):  respond with uptime/packets/errors\n    • PKT_SELFTEST_REQ (0x06):  respond with all test results\n  → vTaskDelay(1ms) ≈ 1kHz polling\n\nTASK 2: timeout_monitor_task  (stack=2048, priority=8)  [main.c:241]\n  Checks: if (last_packet > 500ms ago) AND motor_enabled:\n    → motor_set_speed(0), servo_set_angle(0), state=FAILSAFE, Red LED\n  → vTaskDelay(50ms)\n\nTASK 3: watchdog_task  (stack=2048, priority=9)  [main.c:258]\n  → watchdog_feed() = esp_task_wdt_reset()  → vTaskDelay(500ms)\n  If not fed for 3s → ESP32 hardware reset!\n\nTASK 4: status_task  (stack=2048, priority=5)  [main.c:262]\n  → g_state.uptime_ms = esp_timer_get_time()/1000  → vTaskDelay(100ms)\n\nTASK 5: led_indicator_task  (stack=2048, priority=6)  [main.c:269]\n  → switch(state):  BOOT=amber | SELFTEST=blue | READY/ACTIVE=green | ERROR/FAILSAFE=red\n  → vTaskDelay(100ms)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "s8h", "type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 2870, "width": 900, "height": 35, "text": "8. SHUTDOWN SEQUENCE", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 },

    { "id": "b-shutdown", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 2920, "width": 1000, "height": 150, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "roundness": { "type": 3, "value": 8 } },
    { "id": "t-shutdown", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 2935, "width": 970, "height": 120, "text": "SHUTDOWN FLOW [manager.py: stop() + shutdown()]:\n\n1. Ctrl+C or SIGINT/SIGTERM received\n2. SystemManager.stop():\n   → scheduler._running = False (async while loop exits)\n   → perf.stop() (daemon thread joins)\n3. await mgr.shutdown():\n   For each component IN REVERSE registration order:\n     if hasattr(comp, \"close\"): comp.close()\n     → camera._cap.release()\n     → tof._bus.close() / imu._bus.close() / mag._bus.close() (I²C bus release)\n     → uart._serial.close() (serial port release)\n     (and so on for each registered component)\n4. Log health summary + perf report\n5. \"Shutdown complete\"\n\nESP32: On power loss, watchdog timeout (3s not fed), or emergency stop packet:\n  → Motors stop → Servo centers → State=FAILSAFE → Red LED\n  If watchdog not fed for 3s → hardware reset", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100 }
  ],
  "files": {}
}